<!-- wp:group {"className":"sb-legal__body"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group sb-legal__body"><!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"before","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="before"><span>01</span> Before work starts</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you cancel before we have started, you receive a full refund. Work usually starts once your project details are complete and we have confirmed the plan with you.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"consumer","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="consumer"><span>02</span> Your 14-day cancellation right (UK consumers)</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you buy as a consumer, you can cancel within 14 days of your order. If you asked us to begin during those 14 days, we will refund the price minus the value of the work already done. If the service has been fully delivered within the 14 days at your request, the right to cancel no longer applies.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"after-start","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="after-start"><span>03</span> After work has started</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We refund the value of the work not yet done. Where deliverables are partly complete, for example 10 of 20 links placed, you keep what has been delivered and receive a refund for the rest.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"after-delivery","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="after-delivery"><span>04</span> After delivery</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Delivered work is not refundable simply because you changed your mind. If what we delivered does not match the package description, tell us within 14 days. We will fix or complete it first. If we cannot, we will refund the affected part.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"replacements","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="replacements"><span>05</span> Link replacements</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Profile and citation links that are not live on the day we deliver your report are replaced. Guest posts that are removed within 90 days of publication are replaced with a placement of the same tier or better. Replacements are the remedy for removed links, rather than refunds.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"results","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="results"><span>06</span> Rankings and traffic</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not guarantee rankings or traffic (see our <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>), so refunds are not available because search results did not change.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"how","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="how"><span>07</span> How to request a refund</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@seobooster.uk">hello@seobooster.uk</a> with your order number and a short reason. We reply within two working days. Approved refunds are sent to your original payment method within 5 working days. Your bank may take a few more days to show it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"disputes","className":"sb-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading sb-legal__h" id="disputes"><span>08</span> Before opening a dispute</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Please contact us first. Most problems are solved quickly by email, and a bank chargeback can take weeks for both sides.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
